benchmark/harness/node_modules
benchmark/harness/.venv/
benchmark/harness/data/
benchmark/harness/runs/
benchmark/harness/logs/
benchmark/harness/notes/
benchmark/harness/vab*/
benchmark/harness/report-*.md
benchmark/tools/work/
